/*
 * Declares the MapIteratorBeginValue class.
 *
 * MapIteratorBeginValue represents the creation of an iterator positioned at
 * the beginning of a map. This is the entry point for iterating over a map’s
 * contents. Ymir map iterators are dynamically allocated and remain valid even
 * when the map is structurally modified during iteration.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::map::iteration::begin
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/map/iteration/begin.yr
